SUMMARY:Alice’s Tea Party
DESCRIPTION:Leave the logic of the everyday world behind and step into the extraordinary. You are cordially invited to a delightfully topsy-turvy afternoon tea that is hosted by Alice herself. Expect an afternoon of whimsical conversation\, curious company\, and perhaps a bit of madness. Whether you’re as mad as a hatter or just looking for a unique escape\, throw on your finest whimsical attire and join us. Space is limited\, so don’t be late for this very important date! \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
